    -- To use BYOP, specify a value that ends in _BYOP.
    -- For non-GPU-enabled bundles (bundles other than Graphics or GraphicsPro), specify
    -- BYOL_REGULAR, BYOL_REGULAR_WSP, or BYOL_REGULAR_BYOP,
    -- depending on the protocol.
    -- The BYOL_REGULAR_BYOP and BYOL_GRAPHICS_G4DN_BYOP values
    -- are only supported by Amazon WorkSpaces Core. Contact your account team to be
